      ],
      "content": "GREAT GAUDESDEN        PIPERS HILL TL 01 SW                                         (North side) 3/113                                   Nos. 2/3 26.1.67                                 (Formerly listed as 2/3 Piper Hill) GV                                     II House, 2 houses in C19, now one house. Late C17, brick front mid C19. Timber frame with C18 red brick-on-edge infill exposed at gable ends. Red brick in Flemish-bond to front with timber surround to panel of herringbone brickwork between the 2 ground floor windows. Steep old red tile roof. A house of 1 1/2 storeys, set back from road and facing S, with 2 2-light lattice leaded windows, blocked doorway on RH and studded, boarded door on LH under a flat arch. 2 gabled dormers rising through eaves. C19 lean-to extension at LH end. Listing NGR: TL0288411182"
    }
  ],
